# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository regardless of the developer's
# platform, and let git decide the checkout ending per-platform. This project
# targets Windows for delivery (Phase 7) while being developed cross-platform,
# so this avoids CRLF/LF diff noise and Windows-vs-Linux inconsistency.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
